{"title":"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/7/16794ed8d576bcdfc1b48ac2155ce53ff11aff25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2014$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> is between\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/1/ec1fc643fe2c956e440209228a8b65a6a1643c5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   10^{0} \\text{ and } 10^{1}  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   10^{1} \\text{ and } 10^{2} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   10^{2} \\text{ and } 10^{3} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   10^{3} \\text{ and } 10^{4} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   10^{4} \\text{ and } 10^{5} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"784\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/0513ced521ab28767bf85b9153874f199c724907.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{1} = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/7/84705052e34f89eba551a3d2a6499109e0e015de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{2} = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2c2746079efadac5037139581438e83fa4290c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{3} = 1~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/9/f99e98f2659263099276a192f109f98176b67219.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{4} = 10~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/0/3c029b35d52ad03ade1b09d9787707c4ae580786.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{5} = 100~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>From this, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/7/16794ed8d576bcdfc1b48ac2155ce53ff11aff25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2014$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/e/3ae3582f1041e49e23b02c5031a08458fd3165ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 10^{3} \\text{ and } 10^{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"138\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat\">2014 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1\">Probl